Subject: [PATCH 1538/1695] dts: stm32: expose vdda18adc regulator to CM33
 agent in stm32mp251.dtsi

Expose vdda18adc regulator to CM33 agent with ID 7.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git 62e949aefa6a8faf243d0426f67f3162608f6537 dts: stm32: expose vdda18adc regulator to CM33 agent in stm32mp251.dtsi]
Signed-off-by: Valentin Caron <valentin.caron@foss.st.com>
Change-Id: I267eabc9e2da08ab039678f569f088d602a087c9
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/optee/optee_os/+/438060
Reviewed-by: Thomas BOURGOIN <thomas.bourgoin@foss.st.com>
Domain-Review: Patrick DELAUNAY <patrick.delaunay@foss.st.com>
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
---
 core/arch/arm/dts/stm32mp25-st-scmi-cfg.dtsi | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/core/arch/arm/dts/stm32mp25-st-scmi-cfg.dtsi b/core/arch/arm/dts/stm32mp25-st-scmi-cfg.dtsi
index 5e5515521..edd6bb632 100644
--- a/core/arch/arm/dts/stm32mp25-st-scmi-cfg.dtsi
+++ b/core/arch/arm/dts/stm32mp25-st-scmi-cfg.dtsi
@@ -1651,6 +1651,11 @@
 						reg = <VOLTD_SCMI_UCPD>;
 						voltd-supply = <&vdd33ucpd>;
 					};
+
+					regulator@7 {
+						reg = <VOLTD_SCMI_ADC>;
+						voltd-supply = <&vdda18adc>;
+					};
 				};
 			};
 		};
